  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これ、ソロ曲の……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自意識過剰な感じですみません……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030020050",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080010"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、大人の方ですし、\r\n欲しいものはご自分で買うでしょうから",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、そんなことはないけど\r\nでも、いろいろ考えてくれたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080030",
    "autoWaitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "こうして私がアイドルをしているのも、\r\nアイドルとして歩いていられるのも",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーのおかげなので、\r\nそのお礼のつもりです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お礼というか、『ここまで来ることができた』という\r\n証明……証拠？　でしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『最初のファン』って言ってくださったプロデューサーに\r\nアイドル・風野灯織としてできることをしたくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！\r\nありがとう、灯織。最高のプレゼントだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんなにいいものをもらっちゃったら、\r\n俺ももっと頑張らないとなぁ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっ\r\nいえ、プロデューサーは仕事をしすぎなので",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今まで通り……というか、\r\n今よりもう少し力を抜いていただけたら嬉しいんですが",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490110008/4901100080090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかなぁ\r\n灯織のほうが頑張ってるからな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901100080100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ええ……\r\nそんなことはないと思うんですけど……",
